ation period from 10 days  to 5 for those who have breakthrough  cases  the government approved this request for  the health care industry and honestly if  it's good enough for hospital workers  for nurses and doctors i think it should  be good enough for the airline industry  as well  it wasn't just trouble in the skies the  cruise ship industry is also facing  covet disruptions three cruise lines had  outbreaks on board in the last week with  dozens of passengers testing positive  and forced to quarantine you had to be  fully vaccinated and you had to have a  negative test  two days before i mean what more could  they do before you  aborted the [ __ ]  a lot of frustration hartevelt says some  of the best advice for travelers  especially if you're flying is to sign  up for text alerts that way you'll be  notified immediately if there are any  disruptions to your plans to rika  text alerts and a lot of deep breathing  jonathan vigliotti thank you
 

